# Request
string robot_package          # e.g. "inmoov_urdf"
string config_name            # name of config to retrieve (empty = active)
---
# Response
bool success
string message
string robot_package          # ROS package name wired on `lucy_config_services` (e.g. inmoov_urdf)
string config_name            # resolved config name
string config_yaml            # full YAML content as string
# Last preset successfully written to firmware (active_meta.yaml); empty if never flashed via pipeline
string flashed_config_name
string flashed_at             # ISO-8601 UTC timestamp; empty if unknown / never flashed
string motors_yaml            # specs of the motors the config's actuators use, by motor ref
